        "body": "A tokenizer converts text into a sequence.",
        "narration": "Start with input text, such as a question typed into a chat box. A tokenizer converts that input text into tokens. The resulting sequence is the representation the model receives before further numerical processing. Text that looks simple to us can therefore occupy several positions in that sequence.",
