      {
        "id": 4,
        "headline": "What goes into a request?",
        "body": "The application assembles the model input.",
        "narration": "Instructions tell the model how to respond. Conversation history supplies earlier exchanges, and the current question adds the immediate task. The application packages these parts into model input. Extra formatting and special tokens can contribute to the total, so the visible chat text may not be the entire input.",
